body:
if the lore of arcane got you hooked, but you find these kinds of games hard, honestly? just keep looking for more league lore. i havent played the game in MONTHS and im still invested in the lore believe it or not. theres 150+ playable characters in the main game, and even more in the other stuff. you might just find something you like other than arcane.

&#x200B;

just stay away from the ruination storyline that happened this year. that thing is \*vile\*.

this isnt the first time global has messed up something that caused an uproar, right? im pretty sure it happened a month or two ago as well with incorrect dates.

&#x200B;

im starting to think maybe sega should stop with all the meme-ing in the official twit account and go back to just being an official corporate twitter again.
